WEBVTT

1
00:00.400 --> 00:04.514
A name may contain letters, digits, a dollar sign and an underscore.

2
00:04.514 --> 00:08.207
A name may not start with a digit, and a hyphen is not allowed.

3
00:08.207 --> 00:12.541
Reserved words like let, class or return can't be used as a name.

4
00:12.541 --> 00:17.451
Capitals matter: apple and [[AppLE|apple with capitals]] are two different variables.
